@startuml Sequence_AI_Problem_Creator
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}

title Sequence Diagram: AI Problem Creator (ALOJ moi)

actor "Admin" as A
participant "Django Site\n(Admin View)" as Site
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "AI Provider\n(OpenAI/Gemini/Claude)\nVision API" as AI

== 1. Admin truy cap trang tao de ==
A -> Site : GET /admin/judge/problem/ai-create/
Site --> A : Form upload file\n+ chon Provider/Model

== 2. Upload file de bai ==
A -> Site : POST multipart/form-data\n{file (PDF/PNG/JPG/WEBP),\nprovider, model, output_language}

== 3. Validate ==
Site -> Site : Kiem tra:\n- File type hop le\n- File size <= 10MB\n- Provider ho tro vision\n  (DeepSeek KHONG ho tro)

== 4. Lay API key ==
Site -> DB : SELECT AIAPIKey\nWHERE user=admin,\nprovider=provider,\nstatus='verified'
Site -> Site : Giai ma API key\nbang Fernet

== 5. Chuan bi payload ==
Site -> Site : Encode file sang Base64

alt OpenAI
  Site -> Site : Build payload:\ninput_image (PNG/JPG)\nhoac input_file (PDF)
else Google Gemini
  Site -> Site : Build payload:\ninline_data {mime_type, data}
else Anthropic Claude
  Site -> Site : Build payload:\nimage/document block\n{type, media_type, data}
end

== 6. Lay prompt template ==
Site -> DB : SELECT AIPromptTemplate\nWHERE key='ai_problem_creator'
DB --> Site : prompt template

== 7. Goi Vision AI API ==
Site -> AI : HTTPS POST\n{system_prompt,\nimage/document data}\ntimeout=120s

AI -> AI : Phan tich hinh anh/PDF:\n- Trich xuat ten bai\n- Trich xuat de bai\n- Trich xuat rang buoc\n- Trich xuat sample I/O\n- Chuyen sang Markdown

AI --> Site : Response\n{markdown_content}

== 8. Tra ket qua ==
Site -> Site : Parse response\nStrip code fences
Site --> A : JSON {markdown_content}

== 9. Admin review va ap dung ==
A -> A : Xem preview Markdown\nChinh sua neu can
A -> Site : Apply vao form\ntao problem moi
Site -> DB : INSERT Problem\n{code, name, description, ...}

@enduml
